Bundled chunk-counting tokenizer
================================

tokenizer.json.xz is the XLM-RoBERTa SentencePiece tokenizer as published with
intfloat/multilingual-e5-large (https://huggingface.co/intfloat/multilingual-e5-large),
re-serialized as compact JSON and compressed with xz. Nothing else was changed:
it yields the same token ids as the multilingual-e5-large and BAAI/bge-m3
tokenizers.

The model card publishes it under the MIT License. The underlying XLM-R
SentencePiece model comes from fairseq (MIT License, Copyright (c) Facebook,
Inc. and its affiliates).

Folio uses it only to count tokens when sizing chunks
(src/domain/rag/chunk_tokenizer.py). It is never used for embedding.
